;; clj-kondo configuration exported to any project that depends on
;; com.wagoe/wagoe-workflow.
;;
;; `defworkflow` binds a var and registers the definition. clj-kondo cannot
;; expand the macro from a published jar, so without this every consuming
;; project reports the bound name as an unresolved symbol and has to add the
;; same :lint-as entry to its own .clj-kondo/config.edn by hand (BOU-503).
;;
;; Exported rather than documented: a rule the framework knows belongs with the
;; framework, not in a paragraph each user has to find and copy.
{:lint-as {wagoe.workflow.shell.registry/defworkflow clojure.core/def}}
